# The talk with both girls. Conversation.Trio picks these;
# every rule has a stock line in the code as a fallback, so a missing slot only means the stock line.
# Slots: {other} the other girl, {topic} what they disagree about, {event} this week's event.
# Keys: moment (rivals confront thanks quarrel bestfriend leftout gossip hangout caught lunch club study season trisal),
# pair (bff friend rival other: how the two get along), trisal, othergf, likes, otherlikes (yes/no),
# lvl (friend romance spicy) q (good neutral bad) wrel (yourgf trisal bff friend rival other) for the witness,
# kiss (yes wary no), argue (yes/no), kind (banter idle), act (what you did, for the replies).

# ================= the opening of the everyday moments =================
@rule duo3.open.a.lunch.gentle
on duo3.open.a
when moment=lunch tone=gentle
feel smile
- [Um... we were about to eat. Would you like to join us?|We saved you a seat... if you want it.|Lunch? With us? ...Please?]
- [We pushed two desks together. There's a third chair.|I was hoping we'd run into you before lunch.|We're eating by the window today. Come?]

@rule duo3.open.a.lunch.energetic
on duo3.open.a
when moment=lunch tone=energetic
feel smile
- [Hey hey! Lunch! You're eating with us, right?!|There you are! We're starving, come on!|Lunch time! You're coming with us!]
- [Lunch squad, assemble! You're the third member!|We grabbed the good bench! Hurry!|I'm so hungry I could eat your lunch too!]

@rule duo3.open.a.lunch.cool
on duo3.open.a
when moment=lunch tone=cool
feel smile
- [We're having lunch. Join us.|You haven't eaten yet. Sit with us.|Lunch. Now. You're coming.]
- [We kept a seat. Don't waste it.|Eat with us. It's not a request.|We're going to the roof. You too.]

@rule duo3.open.a.lunch.teasing
on duo3.open.a
when moment=lunch tone=teasing
feel smile
- [We're having lunch. Join us.|You haven't eaten yet. Sit with us.|Lunch. Now. You're coming.]
- [Lunch with two girls. Lucky you~|We drew straws to decide who'd ask you. I lost. Hehe.|Sit between us. We don't mind~]

@rule duo3.open.b.lunch.gentle
on duo3.open.b
when moment=lunch tone=gentle
- [I made a little extra today...|{Other} wouldn't stop talking about asking you.|It's nicer with three, right?]
- [I wasn't sure what you like, so I brought a bit of everything.|We could share our side dishes?]

@rule duo3.open.b.lunch.energetic
on duo3.open.b
when moment=lunch tone=energetic
- [I brought snacks to share!|Come on, before the bread's all gone!|The roof's free today, let's go!]
- [Trade you my sausage for your egg!|Whoever finishes last cleans up!]

@rule duo3.open.b.lunch.cool
on duo3.open.b
when moment=lunch tone=cool
- [There's room.|We don't bite.|You'd better not say no~]
- [Sit. The food's getting cold.|We already ordered for you.]

@rule duo3.open.b.lunch.teasing
on duo3.open.b
when moment=lunch tone=teasing
- [There's room.|We don't bite.|You'd better not say no~]
- [Want me to feed you? Say ah~|{Other} made the rice balls. Be nice about them~|You can pick whose lunch to steal from~]

@rule duo3.open.a.club.gentle
on duo3.open.a
when moment=club tone=gentle
- [Ah... club just finished. We were talking about you.|Practice ran long today...|We just got out of club. Do you have a minute?]
- [We just finished cleaning up the club room...|Club's over... I'm glad we caught you.]

@rule duo3.open.a.club.energetic
on duo3.open.a
when moment=club tone=energetic
- [Club was SO intense today! We have to tell you!|Phew, club's done! Guess what happened!|You missed it! Club was crazy today!]
- [We survived club! Barely! High five!|Club's done, and we've got news!]

@rule duo3.open.a.club.cool
on duo3.open.a
when moment=club tone=cool
- [Club's over. We wanted your opinion.|Practice is done. Spare a minute?|Club ended early. Lucky you.]
- [Club's done. Walk with us.|We finished early. You're our excuse to leave.]

@rule duo3.open.a.club.teasing
on duo3.open.a
when moment=club tone=teasing
- [Club's over. We wanted your opinion.|Practice is done. Spare a minute?|Club ended early. Lucky you.]
- [Did you come to watch us practice? How sweet~|Club's over. Perfect timing. Suspicious timing~|We saw you looking through the window~]

@rule duo3.open.b.club.gentle
on duo3.open.b
when moment=club tone=gentle
- [We both messed up the same part... hehe.|{Other} did really well today, you know.|I'm so tired... but it was fun.]
- [The upperclassmen were really nice today.|I think I'm finally getting the hang of it.]

@rule duo3.open.b.club.energetic
on duo3.open.b
when moment=club tone=energetic
- [I totally nailed it today! Ask {other}!|We're gonna win the next one, I can feel it!|Our captain made us run laps AGAIN!]
- [Coach said I'm improving! Finally!|We need a cheering section. You're it!]

@rule duo3.open.b.club.cool
on duo3.open.b
when moment=club tone=cool
- [It went fine.|We have a meet coming up.|The club could use more people. Hint.]
- [{Other} carried the team today. Don't tell her I said that.|We'll need a ride to the next meet. Just saying.]

@rule duo3.open.b.club.teasing
on duo3.open.b
when moment=club tone=teasing
- [It went fine.|We have a meet coming up.|The club could use more people. Hint.]
- [Join our club. We'll go easy on you. Maybe~|{Other} kept looking at the door. Wonder who she was waiting for~]

@rule duo3.open.a.study.gentle
on duo3.open.a
when moment=study tone=gentle
feel worried
- [Exams are coming up... would you study with us?|I don't understand anything in this chapter...|Could you help us study? Please?]
- [We reserved a table at the library... there's room for one more.|I'm scared of this exam. Studying together helps.]

@rule duo3.open.a.study.energetic
on duo3.open.a
when moment=study tone=energetic
feel worried
- [Exams! Help! We're doomed!|Okay, study group! You're in it now!|Tell us you understand math. Please.]
- [Emergency study session! You're the professor now!|We're going to cram until the guard kicks us out!]

@rule duo3.open.a.study.cool
on duo3.open.a
when moment=study tone=cool
feel worried
- [Exams are this week. We're studying. Join us.|Three heads are better than two.|You look like you could use a study group.]
- [Library. Now. We have a plan.|We split the chapters. You take the hard one.]

@rule duo3.open.a.study.teasing
on duo3.open.a
when moment=study tone=teasing
feel worried
- [Exams are this week. We're studying. Join us.|Three heads are better than two.|You look like you could use a study group.]
- [Help us study and we'll reward you. Somehow~|We need a tutor. A cute one. You'll do~|Teach us, sensei~]

@rule duo3.open.b.study.gentle
on duo3.open.b
when moment=study tone=gentle
- {student}[I made notes... maybe they'll help.|{Other} says you're good at this.|We could quiz each other?]
- [We can take breaks. Short ones.|If we finish early, maybe we can get tea?]

@rule duo3.open.b.study.energetic
on duo3.open.b
when moment=study tone=energetic
- [If I fail I'm blaming both of you!|Snacks first, then studying! Deal?|I brought three highlighters!]
- [First one to fall asleep buys juice!|I made flashcards! Some of them are even right!]

@rule duo3.open.b.study.cool
on duo3.open.b
when moment=study tone=cool
- [I've already done the reading.|If you slow us down, you buy the drinks.|Don't get distracted, okay?]
- [Phones away. All three.|I'll check your answers. Don't sulk.]

@rule duo3.open.b.study.teasing
on duo3.open.b
when moment=study tone=teasing
- [I've already done the reading.|If you slow us down, you buy the drinks.|Don't get distracted, okay?]
- [Every right answer gets a reward. Every wrong one gets a flick~|Try not to stare at us instead of the book~]

@rule duo3.open.a.season.gentle
on duo3.open.a
when moment=season tone=gentle evkind!=gift
feel smile
- [{Event} is this week... have you made plans?|We were talking about {event}...|What are you doing for {event}?]
- [We were wondering if you'd want to spend {event} with us...|{Event} is almost here. It feels special this year.]

@rule duo3.open.a.season.energetic
on duo3.open.a
when moment=season tone=energetic evkind!=gift
feel smile
- [{Event}! {Event}! Are you ready?!|It's almost {event}! We have SO many plans!|You know what week it is? {Event} week!]
- [{Event} plans meeting! Right now! Here!|We've been planning {event} all week! You're in!]

@rule duo3.open.a.season.cool
on duo3.open.a
when moment=season tone=cool evkind!=gift
feel smile
- [{Event} is coming. We need a third.|About {event}. We have a proposal.|You're free for {event}, I assume.]
- [{Event}. Three tickets. Do the math.|We've decided how {event} goes. You're part of it.]

@rule duo3.open.a.season.teasing
on duo3.open.a
when moment=season tone=teasing evkind!=gift
feel smile
- [{Event} is coming. We need a third.|About {event}. We have a proposal.|You're free for {event}, I assume.]
- [Who are you spending {event} with? Wrong. Us~|{Event}'s coming, and we know you're free. Don't lie~]

@rule duo3.open.b.season.gentle
on duo3.open.b
when moment=season tone=gentle evkind!=gift
- [It would be more fun with you...|We could go together, the three of us?|I've been looking forward to it all week.]
- [We could all pick something together...|Only if you want to, of course.]

@rule duo3.open.b.season.energetic
on duo3.open.b
when moment=season tone=energetic evkind!=gift
- [It's gonna be awesome! You HAVE to come!|We already decided you're coming!|I'm so excited I can't sit still!]
- [Say yes! Say yes! Say yes!|We already made a schedule! It has colors!]

@rule duo3.open.b.season.cool
on duo3.open.b
when moment=season tone=cool evkind!=gift
- [Think about it.|Don't make other plans.|We'll be waiting~]
- [You'd regret saying no.|Wear something nice.]

@rule duo3.open.b.season.teasing
on duo3.open.b
when moment=season tone=teasing evkind!=gift
- [Think about it.|Don't make other plans.|We'll be waiting~]
- [It'll be our little secret~|Two dates for the price of one. What a deal~]

@rule duo3.open.a.trisal.gentle
on duo3.open.a
when moment=trisal tone=gentle
feel love
- [Um... we both wanted to see you.|We talked, and... we wanted to spend time with you. Together.|Is it okay if we both stay with you a while?]
- [We missed you... both of us.|It feels right, the three of us together.]

@rule duo3.open.a.trisal.energetic
on duo3.open.a
when moment=trisal tone=energetic
feel love
- [Surprise! Double girlfriend attack!|We came as a set today! Hehe!|Guess who decided to team up?]
- [Group hug! Now! No escaping!|Your two favorite people are here!]

@rule duo3.open.a.trisal.cool
on duo3.open.a
when moment=trisal tone=cool
feel love
- [We agreed. Today you're ours. Both of us.|We've decided to share you. Today, at the same time.|You have two girlfriends. Might as well see them together.]
- [We decided you've been neglecting us. Both of us.|You're coming with us. That's settled.]

@rule duo3.open.a.trisal.teasing
on duo3.open.a
when moment=trisal tone=teasing
feel love
- [We agreed. Today you're ours. Both of us.|We've decided to share you. Today, at the same time.|You have two girlfriends. Might as well see them together.]
- [Which of us did you miss more? Careful~|Two girlfriends, one boy. You'd better keep up~|We've been planning something. Together~]

@rule duo3.open.b.trisal.gentle
on duo3.open.b
when moment=trisal tone=gentle
feel shy
- [It's a little embarrassing... but I'm happy.|{Other} said it was okay...|Don't look at us like that...]
- [Hold my hand too...?|I don't mind sharing. Really.]

@rule duo3.open.b.trisal.energetic
on duo3.open.b
when moment=trisal tone=energetic
feel shy
- [You're so lucky, you know that?|Two of us! Can you handle it?!|We're the best team ever!]
- [Left side's mine! Right side's hers!|We're unstoppable together!]

@rule duo3.open.b.trisal.cool
on duo3.open.b
when moment=trisal tone=cool
feel shy
- [Don't get used to it~|You should be honored.|Behave and we'll do this more often~]
- [Don't play favorites.|We're keeping score, you know.]

@rule duo3.open.b.trisal.teasing
on duo3.open.b
when moment=trisal tone=teasing
feel shy
- [Don't get used to it~|You should be honored.|Behave and we'll do this more often~]
- [Pay attention to both of us, or else~|She gets the left, I get the right. Fair?~]

@rule duo3.open.a.any.gentle
on duo3.open.a
when tone=gentle
- [Ah, there you are...|We were looking for you.|Do you have a moment?]
- [Oh, good... we hoped we'd find you.|Sorry, are you busy?]

@rule duo3.open.a.any.energetic
on duo3.open.a
when tone=energetic
- [Hey hey! Found you!|There he is!|Yo! We need you!]
- [Gotcha! You're with us now!|Two against one! You're surrounded!]

@rule duo3.open.a.any.cool
on duo3.open.a
when tone=cool
- [There you are.|Good, you're here.|We wanted a word.]
- [We have a question.|Don't go anywhere.]

@rule duo3.open.a.any.teasing
on duo3.open.a
when tone=teasing
- [There you are.|Good, you're here.|We wanted a word.]
- [Oh my, look who it is~|We caught you. Now you're ours for a bit~|Were you avoiding us? Hehe~]

@rule duo3.open.b.any.gentle
on duo3.open.b
when tone=gentle
- [We were hoping to see you.|Hi... sorry to bother you.|We won't keep you long.]
- [Just a little while, okay?|We were talking, and your name came up.]

@rule duo3.open.b.any.energetic
on duo3.open.b
when tone=energetic
- [We were looking all over!|C'mon, hang out with us!|Don't run off!]
- [We have so much to tell you!|You look bored. We can fix that!]

@rule duo3.open.b.any.cool
on duo3.open.b
when tone=cool
- [We were just talking about you.|Speak of the devil.|Don't keep us waiting~]
- [Sit.|You'll want to hear this.]

@rule duo3.open.b.any.teasing
on duo3.open.b
when tone=teasing
- [We were just talking about you.|Speak of the devil.|Don't keep us waiting~]
- [Your ears must be burning~|We were saying nice things. Mostly~]

# ================= the two of them talking (after a turn, or in a silence) =================
@rule duo3.callback.gentle
on duo3.callback
when tone=gentle
- [Ah, sorry, we left you out...|Hehe, sorry, we got carried away...|You've been so quiet...]
- [Sorry... what do you think?|We didn't mean to leave you out.]
- [Sorry, we kept talking...|Are you bored?] [What were you going to say?|Please, join us.]

@rule duo3.callback.energetic
on duo3.callback
when tone=energetic
- [Hey, you're quiet! Say something!|Earth to you! Hello?|Don't just stand there, join in!]
- [Your turn! Talk!|Don't zone out on us!]
- [Hey! You're part of this too!|Don't go quiet on us!] [Pick a side!|What do you think?]

@rule duo3.callback.cool
on duo3.callback
when tone=cool
- [...You've been quiet.|Say something.|You're thinking about something.]
- [Your opinion. Now.|You're awfully quiet today.]
- [You're just listening?|Not joining in?] [Fine. Ask something.|We don't bite.]

@rule duo3.callback.teasing
on duo3.callback
when tone=teasing
- [...You've been quiet.|Say something.|You're thinking about something.]
- [Bored of us already? Rude~|Were you staring at one of us? Which one?~]

# ================= the witness: what she makes of a turn aimed at her friend =================
@rule duo3.react.friend.gentle
on duo3.react
when lvl=friend q!=bad tone=gentle
feel smile
- [Hehe, you two get along.|Aww, that's nice.|You're good at this, you know.]
- [You always know what to say to her.|She looks happy. I'm glad.|You two are sweet together, as friends.]

@rule duo3.react.friend.energetic
on duo3.react
when lvl=friend q!=bad tone=energetic
feel smile
- [Hey, don't leave me out!|Me next! Me next!|Ooh, I want one too!]
- [Ooh, nice one!|Ha! She liked that!|Do me next! Do me next!]

@rule duo3.react.friend.cool
on duo3.react
when lvl=friend q!=bad tone=cool
feel smile
- [...Hm. Not bad.|You're in a good mood.|Fine. I'll allow it.]
- [...Not bad.|Smooth.|Hm. She's smiling.]

@rule duo3.react.friend.teasing
on duo3.react
when lvl=friend q!=bad tone=teasing
feel smile
- [...Hm. Not bad.|You're in a good mood.|Fine. I'll allow it.]
- [Wow, someone's popular.|Should I leave you two alone?|And what do I get?]

@rule duo3.react.bad.gentle
on duo3.react
when q=bad tone=gentle
feel worried
- [Ah... that didn't go well...|Um... maybe try something else...|Oh no...]
- [Um... maybe try something else?|Oh... that didn't go well.|She didn't like that, I think.]

@rule duo3.react.bad.energetic
on duo3.react
when q=bad tone=energetic
feel worried
- [Pfft! Smooth!|Ouch! Shot down!|Hahaha! Nice try!]
- [Ouch! That was rough!|Yikes! Try again!|Wow, nope! Not like that!]

@rule duo3.react.bad.cool
on duo3.react
when q=bad tone=cool
feel worried
- [...Nice try.|That was painful to watch.|Well. That happened.]
- [...Bad idea.|That missed.|Don't do that again.]

@rule duo3.react.bad.teasing
on duo3.react
when q=bad tone=teasing
feel worried
- [...Nice try.|That was painful to watch.|Well. That happened.]
- [Smooth. Really smooth.|Want some tips?|I'm writing that one down.]

@rule duo3.react.romance.yourgf.gentle
on duo3.react
when lvl=romance wrel=yourgf q!=bad tone=gentle
feel pout
- [U-um... I'm right here, you know...|You're my boyfriend... remember?|...You never say that to me.]
- [...You're sweet to her too, huh.|I'm right here, you know...|...Say something nice to me too.]

@rule duo3.react.romance.yourgf.energetic
on duo3.react
when lvl=romance wrel=yourgf q!=bad tone=energetic
feel pout
- [Hey! Your girlfriend is standing RIGHT here!|Excuse me?! Hello?!|Wow. Okay. I see how it is.]
- [Hey! Hey! I'm your girlfriend!|What about me?!|Don't forget who you're dating!]

@rule duo3.react.romance.yourgf.cool
on duo3.react
when lvl=romance wrel=yourgf q!=bad tone=cool
feel pout
- [...I'm still here.|Interesting. Very interesting.|We'll talk later.]
- [...I see.|Interesting choice of words.|...Noted.]

@rule duo3.react.romance.yourgf.teasing
on duo3.react
when lvl=romance wrel=yourgf q!=bad tone=teasing
feel pout
- [...I'm still here.|Interesting. Very interesting.|We'll talk later.]
- [Careful. I'm keeping score.|Flirting in front of me? Bold.|You'll make it up to me later.]

@rule duo3.react.spicy.yourgf.gentle
on duo3.react
when lvl=spicy wrel=yourgf q!=bad tone=gentle
feel pout
- [W-what are you saying to her...?|That's... that's what you say to ME...|Why her...?]
- [...That's too much, in front of me.|Please... not like that, with me here.|...I don't like this.]

@rule duo3.react.spicy.yourgf.energetic
on duo3.react
when lvl=spicy wrel=yourgf q!=bad tone=energetic
feel pout
- [WHAT did you just say to her?!|Hey! HEY! I heard that!|Are you kidding me right now?!]
- [WHAT?! In front of me?!|Hey! Hands to yourself!|Are you serious right now?!]

@rule duo3.react.spicy.yourgf.cool
on duo3.react
when lvl=spicy wrel=yourgf q!=bad tone=cool
feel pout
- [I heard that.|...Unbelievable.|In front of me. Really.]
- [...You're done for today.|I'm going to remember that.|...We'll talk later.]

@rule duo3.react.spicy.yourgf.teasing
on duo3.react
when lvl=spicy wrel=yourgf q!=bad tone=teasing
feel pout
- [I heard that.|...Unbelievable.|In front of me. Really.]
- [My, my. And I'm your girlfriend.|You'll pay for that tonight.|Oh? Should I start keeping a list?]

@rule duo3.react.trisal.gentle
on duo3.react
when wrel=trisal lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=gentle
feel shy
- [Hehe... don't forget me, okay?|You two are cute.|...My turn next?]
- [...It's nice, seeing you two like this.|I don't mind. Really.|...You'll do the same for me, right?]

@rule duo3.react.trisal.energetic
on duo3.react
when wrel=trisal lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=energetic
feel shy
- [Hey! Me too! Me too!|Save some for me!|Ooh, look at you two!]
- [Aww! My turn after!|Hehe, I love this!|Hey, share!]

@rule duo3.react.trisal.cool
on duo3.react
when wrel=trisal lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=cool
feel shy
- [Fair is fair. I'm next.|I'm keeping count.|Mm. I approve.]
- [...You two.|Fine. Next is mine.|...Cute.]

@rule duo3.react.trisal.teasing
on duo3.react
when wrel=trisal lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=teasing
feel shy
- [Fair is fair. I'm next.|I'm keeping count.|Mm. I approve.]
- [Don't leave me out.|Am I watching or joining?|Save some for me.]

@rule duo3.react.rival.gentle
on duo3.react
when wrel=rival lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=gentle
feel pout
- [...|...Really?|Hmph.]
- [...Of course it's her.|...I see how it is.|She always gets the attention.]

@rule duo3.react.rival.energetic
on duo3.react
when wrel=rival lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=energetic
feel pout
- [Ugh, seriously?|Gross. Get a room.|You can do better.]
- [Seriously? Her?!|Ugh! Of course!|You're wasting that on her!]

@rule duo3.react.rival.cool
on duo3.react
when wrel=rival lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=cool
feel pout
- [...Tch.|Please. She's not your type.|How tasteless.]
- [...Her. Really.|Bad taste.|...Whatever.]

@rule duo3.react.rival.teasing
on duo3.react
when wrel=rival lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=teasing
feel pout
- [...Tch.|Please. She's not your type.|How tasteless.]
- [You can do better than her.|Desperate, are we?|Cute. For her, I mean.]

@rule duo3.react.bff.gentle
on duo3.react
when wrel=bff lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=gentle
feel shy
- [Ah... I-I'll pretend I didn't see that...|Hehe, you two...|Should I... go?]
- [...You two look good together.|I'm happy for her. Really.|She's my best friend. Be good to her.]

@rule duo3.react.bff.energetic
on duo3.react
when wrel=bff lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=energetic
feel shy
- [Ooh! Look at you two!|Oh my gosh! Tell me everything later!|I KNEW it!]
- [Ooh! I'm telling everyone!|Yes! I ship it!|Look at her face! She's red!]

@rule duo3.react.bff.cool
on duo3.react
when wrel=bff lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=cool
feel shy
- [Should I give you two a minute?|Interesting.|I'm telling everyone. Kidding.]
- [...Treat her right.|She likes that. I can tell.|...Hm. Good.]

@rule duo3.react.bff.teasing
on duo3.react
when wrel=bff lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=teasing
feel shy
- [Should I give you two a minute?|Interesting.|I'm telling everyone. Kidding.]
- [I'll hear all about this later, won't I?|Look at her blush~|Should I give you two some room?]

@rule duo3.react.other.gentle
on duo3.react
when lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=gentle
feel shy
- [Um... I'm still here...|O-oh...|Ah... that's...]
- [...Oh. Um.|I'll just... look away.|...That's a little embarrassing to watch.]

@rule duo3.react.other.energetic
on duo3.react
when lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=energetic
feel shy
- [Whoa, getting bold!|Ooh~|Right in front of me, huh?]
- [Whoa! Okay!|Hey, get a room!|Wow, you're bold!]

@rule duo3.react.other.cool
on duo3.react
when lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=cool
feel shy
- [...Should I leave?|Bold.|Don't mind me.]
- [...Hm.|I'm still here.|...Right.]

@rule duo3.react.other.teasing
on duo3.react
when lvl!=friend q!=bad tone=teasing
feel shy
- [...Should I leave?|Bold.|Don't mind me.]
- [Don't mind me.|Should I take notes?|Oh, this is fun to watch.]

# ================= the witness of a kiss =================
@rule duo3.kiss.no.gentle
on duo3.kiss
when kiss=no tone=gentle
feel surprised
- [Ah... she said no...|Oh... um... are you okay?|...That was awkward.]
- [...It's okay. She just wasn't ready.|Oh no... are you all right?|...Maybe ask her another time.]

@rule duo3.kiss.no.energetic
on duo3.kiss
when kiss=no tone=energetic
feel surprised
- [Hah! Shot down!|Ooh, denied!|Ouch! Rejected!]
- [Ooh, rejected! ...Sorry!|Whoa! Shot down!|Ouch! Rough!]

@rule duo3.kiss.no.cool
on duo3.kiss
when kiss=no tone=cool
feel surprised
- [...Denied.|Well. That was a no.|Ouch. Right in front of me~]
- [...She said no.|That was bad timing.|...Read the room.]

@rule duo3.kiss.no.teasing
on duo3.kiss
when kiss=no tone=teasing
feel surprised
- [...Denied.|Well. That was a no.|Ouch. Right in front of me~]
- [Denied~|Better luck next time.|Want to try me instead? Kidding.]

@rule duo3.kiss.yourgf.gentle
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=yourgf tone=gentle
feel sad
- [...You kissed her. Right in front of me.|Why... why her...?|I... I need a moment.]
- [...I thought I was the one you kiss.|...Please don't do that again.|...That hurt.]

@rule duo3.kiss.yourgf.energetic
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=yourgf tone=energetic
feel sad
- [Are you SERIOUS right now?!|You kissed her?! I'm your GIRLFRIEND!|Unbelievable! UNBELIEVABLE!]
- [HEY! What was that?!|You're MY boyfriend!|Did that just happen?!]

@rule duo3.kiss.yourgf.cool
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=yourgf tone=cool
feel sad
- [...I saw that.|So that's how it is.|We are going to talk about this.]
- [...We're talking about this later.|I saw that.|...Don't.]

@rule duo3.kiss.yourgf.teasing
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=yourgf tone=teasing
feel sad
- [...I saw that.|So that's how it is.|We are going to talk about this.]
- [Oh? And what about me?|You owe me ten of those.|Bold. Very bold. You'll regret it.]

@rule duo3.kiss.trisal.gentle
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=trisal tone=gentle
feel shy
- [Hehe... now me, okay?|You two look so cute...|...I'm next.]
- [...My turn next?|You two look so happy.|...I want one too.]

@rule duo3.kiss.trisal.energetic
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=trisal tone=energetic
feel shy
- [Hey! My turn! My turn!|Save some for me!|Aww! Okay, now me!]
- [Me too! Me too!|Hehe! Don't skip me!|My turn!]

@rule duo3.kiss.trisal.cool
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=trisal tone=cool
feel shy
- [Fair is fair.|I'm keeping score.|Mm. Don't forget me.]
- [...Mine's next.|Fair's fair.|...And me?]

@rule duo3.kiss.trisal.teasing
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=trisal tone=teasing
feel shy
- [Fair is fair.|I'm keeping score.|Mm. Don't forget me.]
- [Save some for me.|Line forms here.|Don't think I didn't see that.]

@rule duo3.kiss.rival.gentle
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=rival tone=gentle
feel pout
- [...Why her...|...I'm leaving soon.|...]
- [...Her? Really?|...I see.|...Fine. Kiss her, then.]

@rule duo3.kiss.rival.energetic
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=rival tone=energetic
feel pout
- [EW! Seriously?!|Ugh, get a room!|You have terrible taste!]
- [Gross! Her?!|You kissed HER?!|Ugh! I'm leaving!]

@rule duo3.kiss.rival.cool
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=rival tone=cool
feel pout
- [...Tasteless.|Disgusting.|Hmph.]
- [...Disappointing.|Your taste is awful.|...Whatever.]

@rule duo3.kiss.rival.teasing
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no wrel=rival tone=teasing
feel pout
- [...Tasteless.|Disgusting.|Hmph.]
- [You're kissing that?|Hope she doesn't bite.|Lowering your standards?]

@rule duo3.kiss.friend.gentle
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no tone=gentle
feel shy
- [Eh?! R-right in front of me...?|W-wow...|I... I didn't see anything!]
- [Oh! Um... I'll look away.|...That was sweet.|...You two are so cute.]

@rule duo3.kiss.friend.energetic
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no tone=energetic
feel shy
- [WHOA! Hey! I'm right here!|OH MY GOSH!|Did that just happen?!]
- [WHOA! Right here?!|Ooh! I saw that!|No way! Again!]

@rule duo3.kiss.friend.cool
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no tone=cool
feel shy
- [...I'm standing right here.|Oh my. Don't mind me~|Well. That's new.]
- [...Okay then.|Didn't need to see that.|...Hm.]

@rule duo3.kiss.friend.teasing
on duo3.kiss
when kiss!=no tone=teasing
feel shy
- [...I'm standing right here.|Oh my. Don't mind me~|Well. That's new.]
- [Get a room, you two.|I'll tell everyone~|Wow. Not even shy about it.]

# ================= one of them walks off; the moment ends =================
@rule duo3.leave.gf.gentle
on duo3.leave
when othergf=no wrel=yourgf tone=gentle
feel sad
- [...I'll go. You two have fun.|I don't want to watch this.|I'm going home.]
- [I thought... never mind. Bye.|I'll see you later. Maybe.]

@rule duo3.leave.gf.energetic
on duo3.leave
when othergf=no wrel=yourgf tone=energetic
feel sad
- [Forget it! I'm out!|Have fun with HER!|Don't call me!]
- [Unbelievable! Right in front of me!|I'm so done with you!]

@rule duo3.leave.gf.cool
on duo3.leave
when othergf=no wrel=yourgf tone=cool
feel sad
- [I'm leaving.|We're done here.|Enjoy yourself.]
- [Don't follow me.|Call me when you remember who your girlfriend is.]

@rule duo3.leave.gf.teasing
on duo3.leave
when othergf=no wrel=yourgf tone=teasing
feel sad
- [I'm leaving.|We're done here.|Enjoy yourself.]
- [Have fun. I'll be thinking of ways to get even.|Wow. Remember this when I'm not answering~]

@rule duo3.leave.any.gentle
on duo3.leave
when tone=gentle
feel pout
- [...I'll go. You two have fun.|I think I'm in the way...|Um... I just remembered something.]
- [I should get going... sorry.|I'll leave you two alone.]

@rule duo3.leave.any.energetic
on duo3.leave
when tone=energetic
feel pout
- [Ugh, forget it! I'm out!|Fine! I'm leaving!|Whatever! Bye!]
- [Okay, this is awkward! Bye!|Nope! Not doing this! Bye!]

@rule duo3.leave.any.cool
on duo3.leave
when tone=cool
feel pout
- [...I'm leaving.|I have better things to do.|Wow. Okay. Enjoy yourselves.]
- [Count me out.|I'll go before this gets worse.]

@rule duo3.leave.any.teasing
on duo3.leave
when tone=teasing
feel pout
- [...I'm leaving.|I have better things to do.|Wow. Okay. Enjoy yourselves.]
- [Third wheel, me? I don't think so. Bye~|I know when I'm not wanted. Have fun~]

@rule duo3.left.gentle
on duo3.left
when tone=gentle
feel worried
- [Ah... she left...|Was that my fault...?|Should we go after her?]
- [I hope she's okay...|Maybe we should talk to her later.]

@rule duo3.left.energetic
on duo3.left
when tone=energetic
feel worried
- [Whoa. She's mad.|Yikes.|Uh oh.]
- [Oof. That went badly.|Should we... chase her?]

@rule duo3.left.cool
on duo3.left
when tone=cool
feel worried
- [...Well. That happened.|She'll get over it.|Oops. Somebody's jealous~]
- [She'll be back.|Let her cool off.]

@rule duo3.left.teasing
on duo3.left
when tone=teasing
feel worried
- [...Well. That happened.|She'll get over it.|Oops. Somebody's jealous~]
- [Just us two now. How convenient~|Someone's in trouble. Not me~]

@rule duo3.end.a.gentle
on duo3.end.a
when tone=gentle
- [Ah, look at the time...|We should let you go...|This was really nice.]
- [It's getting late... thank you for staying.|I wish this lasted longer.]

@rule duo3.end.a.energetic
on duo3.end.a
when tone=energetic
- [Whoa, it's already that late?!|Aw, I could talk all day!|Time flies, huh?]
- [No way, already?! Time is cheating!|Okay, okay, we'll let you go. For now!]

@rule duo3.end.a.cool
on duo3.end.a
when tone=cool
- [We should get going.|That's enough for today.|Time's up.]
- [We'll stop here.|That's all for now.]

@rule duo3.end.a.teasing
on duo3.end.a
when tone=teasing
- [We should get going.|That's enough for today.|Time's up.]
- [We'll let you go. This time~|Did we wear you out? Hehe~]

@rule duo3.end.a.lunch.gentle
on duo3.end.a
when moment=lunch tone=gentle
- [Ah, the bell's about to ring...|Thank you for eating with us.|Let's do this again tomorrow?]
- [That was the nicest lunch this week.|I'll make more next time.]

@rule duo3.end.a.lunch.energetic
on duo3.end.a
when moment=lunch tone=energetic
- [Lunch is over already?!|Same time tomorrow!|That was the best lunch!]
- [Full! So full! Worth it!|Lunch squad, dismissed!]

@rule duo3.end.a.lunch.cool
on duo3.end.a
when moment=lunch tone=cool
- [Lunch is over.|Same place tomorrow.|Back to class.]
- [Don't be late for class.|Tomorrow, same table.]

@rule duo3.end.a.lunch.teasing
on duo3.end.a
when moment=lunch tone=teasing
- [Lunch is over.|Same place tomorrow.|Back to class.]
- [Same time tomorrow. Don't eat with anyone else~|You owe us a dessert now~]

@rule duo3.end.b.gentle
on duo3.end.b
when tone=gentle
- [This was nice. Let's do it again.|Thank you for spending time with us.|See you soon...]
- [Take care on the way home.|It was really nice. Really.]

@rule duo3.end.b.energetic
on duo3.end.b
when tone=energetic
- [That was fun! Again sometime!|Bye! Don't forget us!|Next time, we're going somewhere!]
- [Text us! Both of us!|We're doing this again! Promise!]

@rule duo3.end.b.cool
on duo3.end.b
when tone=cool
- [Until next time.|Don't miss us too much~|See you around.]
- [Don't be a stranger.|Same time next week.]

@rule duo3.end.b.teasing
on duo3.end.b
when tone=teasing
- [Until next time.|Don't miss us too much~|See you around.]
- [Dream about us tonight~|Don't forget which of us said goodbye first~]

@rule duo3.end.b.trisal.gentle
on duo3.end.b
when moment=trisal tone=gentle
feel love
- [Let's do this again soon... the three of us.|I'm really happy today.|Thank you... for being ours.]
- [Good night... from both of us.|I like being three. I really do.]

@rule duo3.end.b.trisal.energetic
on duo3.end.b
when moment=trisal tone=energetic
feel love
- [Same time tomorrow! Both of us!|Best day ever!|You're stuck with us forever!]
- [Double good night kiss! Later!|Tomorrow, round two!]

@rule duo3.end.b.trisal.cool
on duo3.end.b
when moment=trisal tone=cool
feel love
- [Don't go getting a third one.|We'll be back~|Remember, you're ours.]
- [Don't keep us waiting next time.|We'll decide where we go next time.]

@rule duo3.end.b.trisal.teasing
on duo3.end.b
when moment=trisal tone=teasing
feel love
- [Don't go getting a third one.|We'll be back~|Remember, you're ours.]
- [Two goodbye kisses. Choose wisely~|Sweet dreams. Of us, obviously~]

# ================= her answer to what you said or did (B's turns and both) =================
@rule duo3.reply.good.gentle
on duo3.reply
when q=good tone=gentle
feel smile
- [Ehehe... thank you.|That's sweet...|I'm happy.]
- [You always say the nicest things...|I'll remember that one.|M-my face is warm...]

@rule duo3.reply.good.energetic
on duo3.reply
when q=good tone=energetic
feel smile
- [Hehe! You're the best!|Yay!|Aww, I like that!]
- [Again! Say it again!|That made my whole day!|Hehe, I'm keeping that!]

@rule duo3.reply.good.cool
on duo3.reply
when q=good tone=cool
feel smile
- [...Thanks.|Not bad.|Hm. Appreciated.]
- [...I'll take that.|Good answer.|...You're learning.]

@rule duo3.reply.good.teasing
on duo3.reply
when q=good tone=teasing
feel smile
- [Aww, trying to win me over?|Hehe, sweet talker.|Is that the best you got? ...I like it.]
- [Oh? Smooth today.|Keep that up and I might fall for it.|Flatterer~ Don't stop.]

@rule duo3.reply.good.other.gentle
on duo3.reply
when q=good otherlikes=yes act!=kiss tone=gentle
feel shy
- [Th-thank you... with {other} right here, too...|Ehehe... {other} is looking at us...|...Don't make {other} jealous.]
- [{Other}, d-don't look at me like that...|...I'm so embarrassed, with {other} here.|{Other} heard that... ehehe.]

@rule duo3.reply.good.other.energetic
on duo3.reply
when q=good otherlikes=yes act!=kiss tone=energetic
feel shy
- [Hehe! {Other}'s gonna be so jealous!|Look, {other}, he likes me!|Ha! Take that, {other}!]
- [{Other}! Did you hear that?!|Hehe, sorry {other}, I win this round!|{Other}, write that down!]

@rule duo3.reply.good.other.cool
on duo3.reply
when q=good otherlikes=yes act!=kiss tone=cool
feel shy
- [...{Other} is watching.|Careful. {Other} is right there.|Bold, with {other} here.]
- [...Pretend {other} didn't hear that.|{Other} will tease me for weeks.|...Not in front of {other}.]

@rule duo3.reply.good.other.teasing
on duo3.reply
when q=good otherlikes=yes act!=kiss tone=teasing
feel shy
- [Saying that with {other} here? Bold~|Look, {other}. He likes me more.|{Other}, close your ears~]
- [Hear that, {other}? He picked me~|Jealous, {other}?|Sorry, {other}. He has taste.]

@rule duo3.reply.neutral.gentle
on duo3.reply
when q=neutral tone=gentle
- [Mm... okay.|I guess...|Hehe...?]
- [Oh... um, thank you, I think.|Ah... I see.|Mm-hm...]

@rule duo3.reply.neutral.energetic
on duo3.reply
when q=neutral tone=energetic
- [Huh. Okay!|Uh, sure!|Hm? Okay!]
- [Okay! ...Wait, what?|Sure, sure!|Ha, okay!]

@rule duo3.reply.neutral.cool
on duo3.reply
when q=neutral tone=cool
- [...Sure.|If you say so.|Hm.]
- [...Noted.|Okay.|...And?]

@rule duo3.reply.neutral.teasing
on duo3.reply
when q=neutral tone=teasing
- [Hmm? Is that all?|Okay~ whatever you say.|Hehe. Sure, sure.]
- [That's it? I expected more.|Hm. A for effort.|Cute. Try harder.]

@rule duo3.reply.bad.gentle
on duo3.reply
when q=bad tone=gentle
feel pout
- [Ah... um... no...|P-please don't...|That's... no.]
- [...That wasn't very nice.|Why would you say that...?|I'd rather you didn't...]

@rule duo3.reply.bad.energetic
on duo3.reply
when q=bad tone=energetic
feel pout
- [Hey! No way!|Not cool!|Ew, no!]
- [Boo! Bad answer!|Nope! Try again!|Rude!]

@rule duo3.reply.bad.cool
on duo3.reply
when q=bad tone=cool
feel pout
- [...No.|Don't.|Not happening.]
- [...Wrong.|That was a mistake.|...Think before you talk.]

@rule duo3.reply.bad.teasing
on duo3.reply
when q=bad tone=teasing
feel pout
- [Oh, you did NOT just say that.|Nice try. Zero points.|In your dreams~]
- [Wow. Really? In front of her?|You're losing points fast.|That's going in my notebook. The bad page.]

# ================= aimed at one, with the other right there =================
# on duo3.pair.<act> (her answer) and duo3.pair.<act>.other (the other girl). Keys: pair, otherlikes, rel, tone.
@rule duo3.pair.about.gentle
on duo3.pair.about
when pair!=rival tone=gentle
feel smile
- [{other} always notices when I'm down... she's like that.|{other} is the kindest person I know. Really.|She listens. Even when I ramble.]
- {student}[She shares her lunch with me every time I forget mine.|{other} waits for me after class. Every day.|When I cried last month, she stayed until I stopped.]
- [I like how {other} laughs. It makes me laugh too.|She's brave in ways I'm not.|She always knows what to say.]

@rule duo3.pair.about.energetic
on duo3.pair.about
when pair!=rival tone=energetic
feel laugh
- [{other}'s SO fun! Every day's an adventure with her!|She never says no to anything! Ever!|She's the loudest person I know! After me!]
- [{other} once ate three melon breads in one break! Legend!|She runs faster than the boys! It's amazing!|She's my partner in crime! Literally!]
- [Everything! She's the best!|{other} makes boring days not boring!|She laughs at my dumb jokes. Every single one!]

@rule duo3.pair.about.cool
on duo3.pair.about
when pair!=rival tone=cool
- [She's honest. That's rare.|{other} doesn't waste words. I respect that.|She's reliable.]
- [She keeps her promises.|{other} doesn't pretend. I like that.|She knows when to leave me alone.]
- [...She's good company.|She doesn't make a fuss.|She's smarter than she lets on.]

@rule duo3.pair.about.teasing
on duo3.pair.about
when pair!=rival tone=teasing
feel smile
- [She laughs at my jokes. Even the bad ones~|{other}? She's adorable when she's flustered. Watch~|She can't keep a secret. It's so cute.]
- [Her face when she's embarrassed. Priceless~|She falls for every prank. Every time.|She pretends to be mad at me. She never is~]
- [She's my favorite victim~|Everything. Don't tell her I said that.|She keeps me out of trouble. Mostly.]

@rule duo3.pair.about.rival
on duo3.pair.about
when pair=rival
feel pout
- [...Like? That's a strong word.|Her? Hm. She tries hard. Too hard.|I don't think about her that much.]
- [...She's persistent. I'll give her that.|She's annoying in a very consistent way.|...Her taste in snacks is okay. That's it.]
- [Why are you asking me that with her right here?|...No comment.|Pass.]

@rule duo3.pair.about.other.friend
on duo3.pair.about.other
when pair!=rival
feel shy
- [E-eh... you're embarrassing me...|Stoooop, I'm blushing!|...You didn't have to say all that.]
- [Hehe... you too, you know.|Aww... come here.|...I'm going to cry, stop it.]
- [D-don't believe her, she exaggerates!|Okay, now I owe her lunch.|...Thanks.]

@rule duo3.pair.about.other.rival
on duo3.pair.about.other
when pair=rival
feel pout
- [...I can hear you, you know.|Wow. Thanks a lot.|...Charming.]
- [Persistent? That's a compliment from you.|At least I try.|...Hmph.]
- [Love you too.|I'm standing right here.|...Noted.]

@rule duo3.pair.story.any
on duo3.pair.story
when pair!=rival
feel laugh
- {student}[Okay, okay... once {other} fell asleep in class and answered the professor in her sleep. She said "five more minutes, mom."|Last summer {other} got her head stuck in the pool ladder. We needed the lifeguard.|{other} sent a love letter to the wrong locker. The wrong person READ it out loud.]
- [{other} practices her confessions in the mirror. I've heard it. It's very dramatic.|She tried to dye her hair at home once. It came out green.|{other} waved back at someone who was waving at the person behind her. For a whole minute.]
- {student}[{other} tripped walking up to get an award. Up the stairs. In front of the whole university.|She called the professor "mom" once. In class. Loud.|{other} still sleeps with a stuffed rabbit named Sir Fluffington.]

@rule duo3.pair.story.rival
on duo3.pair.story
when pair=rival
feel smile
- [Oh, gladly. {other} once fell into the koi pond. On purpose, she says.|Where do I start? She cried during the fire drill.|{other} lost to me at everything. Every. Single. Thing.]
- [She once wore her skirt inside out all day. Nobody told her. Including me.|{other} studied for the wrong test. For a week.|She got stuck in the gym storage. I was the one who heard her.]
- {student}[Hmm... the time she confessed to a professor. By accident.|Her singing. Just ask her to sing.|She brought a lunch box with no lunch in it. Twice.]

@rule duo3.pair.story.other.friend
on duo3.pair.story.other
when pair!=rival
feel surprised
- [Wh-why would you tell him that?!|THAT WAS ONE TIME!|...You promised you'd take that to your grave.]
- [I'm never telling you anything again!|Okay, that's it, I'm telling him about the bus incident!|You traitor!]
- [...I want to disappear.|Don't listen to her! ...It's true, but don't listen!|Revenge. I'm planning revenge.]

@rule duo3.pair.story.other.rival
on duo3.pair.story.other
when pair=rival
feel pout
- [That's a lie and you know it!|At least I don't snore in the library!|...I'll remember this.]
- [Oh, you want to play that game?|Should I tell him what YOU did at the culture festival?|...Petty.]
- [Hmph. Enjoy it while it lasts.|That's not how it happened!|You're the worst.]

@rule duo3.pair.talks.yes
on duo3.pair.talks
when otherlikes=yes
feel smile
- [...She does. A lot, actually.|All the time. It's kind of annoying.|Oh, constantly. Should I tell you what she said~?]
- [She asked me what you like to eat. Twice.|She knows your class schedule by heart. Just saying.|She says your name in her sleep. Probably.]
- [You have no idea.|Every lunch break. Every one.|More than she'd ever admit.]

@rule duo3.pair.talks.no
on duo3.pair.talks
when otherlikes=no
- {student}[Not really... why, should she?|Hmm, not that I remember.|Once, maybe? Something about the assignments.]
- [She talks about food, mostly.|Not really. Feeling ignored?|She mentioned you exist. That counts, right?]
- [...No.|Should she?|You'd have to do something interesting first.]

@rule duo3.pair.talks.other.yes
on duo3.pair.talks.other
when otherlikes=yes
feel shy
- [D-don't tell him that!|HEY! Traitor!|...I'll remember this.]
- [Th-that's not true! ...Not completely.|Why are you like this?!|...Okay. Maybe a little.]
- [I'm going to bury you.|Stop talking. Right now.|...Don't look at me like that.]

@rule duo3.pair.talks.other.no
on duo3.pair.talks.other
when otherlikes=no
- [...Um.|Why would I?|Should I?]
- [Maybe if you were more interesting~|Don't take it personally.|...I'm busy.]
- [...Next question.|Hm.|I talk about lots of things.]

@rule duo3.pair.note.other.any
on duo3.pair.note.other
feel pout
- [...Are you two passing notes?|Hey! What was that?! Let me see!|...I saw that.]
- [Secrets? Without me?|What does it say? Show me!|Very subtle. Not.]
- [I'm right here, you know.|Is it about me?|...Hmph.]

@rule duo3.pair.invite.other.yes
on duo3.pair.invite.other
when pair!=rival
feel smile
- [Me too? ...Okay!|Count me in!|...Fine. I'll come.]
- [Yay! The three of us!|I know a good place!|Wait, I need to pick an outfit.]
- [Only if you pay~|Sure. Someone has to keep you two in line.|Is this a date? Of three?]

@rule duo3.pair.invite.other.rival
on duo3.pair.invite.other
when pair=rival
feel pout
- [...I'll pass, thanks.|With HER? No way.|...Pass.]
- [Have fun without me.|I'd rather stay home.|...I'm busy. Forever.]
- [Hmm, I'll think about it. No.|Not if she's coming.|...Maybe if she cancels.]

@rule duo3.reply.pair.note
on duo3.reply
when act=note q!=bad
feel shy
- [...! (She tucks it away, red to the ears.)|(She reads it under the desk and bites her lip.)|(She folds it smaller and smaller, hiding a smile.)]
- [Hehe... secret mission accepted.|...Later. I'll answer later.|(She mouths: "idiot." She's smiling.)]
- [(She hides it in her sleeve.)|...You're terrible. (She keeps it.)|(She nods, very slightly.)]

@rule duo3.reply.pair.praise.other
on duo3.reply
when act=praise q!=bad otherlikes=yes
feel shy
- [E-eh?! With {other} right here...|Don't say that! {other}'s looking!|...You're going to make her jealous.]
- [Hehe... {other}, did you hear that?|...Stop. {other} is glaring.|Say that when we're alone.]
- [(She glances at {other}, then at you, and goes red.)|...Thanks. Awkward, but thanks.|Ahaha... um...]

@rule duo3.reply.pair.hidden.good
on duo3.reply
when act=hidden q=good
feel love
- [(She laces her fingers with yours, eyes on the floor.)|(She squeezes back and doesn't look at you.)|(Her thumb strokes the back of your hand.)]
- [(She leans a little closer, as if by accident.)|(She stifles a smile.)|(She holds on tighter.)]
- [...(Her hand stays.)|(She traces a slow circle on your palm.)|(She pretends nothing is happening. Her ears are red.)]

# Chocolate Day is not an outing: they come with a box, not a plan.
@rule duo3.open.a.season.gift
on duo3.open.a
when moment=season evkind=gift
feel smile
- [We've been making chocolate together.|We were comparing boxes for {event}.|We're doing {event} as a team this year.]
- [Don't peek in the bag yet!|We made too many. You have to help.|This one has your name on it. Maybe.]

@rule duo3.open.b.season.gift
on duo3.open.b
when moment=season evkind=gift
- [You're our official taster now.|Tell us the truth. Is it too sweet?|Don't tell anyone how many we burned.]
- [She did the wrapping. I did the eating.|Be honest. Which one of us did better?|We argued about the ribbon for an hour.]

